  "prefLabel": "Mec 307.02 Required Supporting Materials",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 307.02 Required Supporting Materials. Business applicants for licensure shall provide the following documents supporting their applications:\n\n(a) Proof of good standing with the secretary of state;\n\n(b) Poof of liability insurance; and\n\n(c) A List of all current licensed employees that includes:\n\n(1) Full name as listed on their license; and\n\n(2) N.H. license number.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13770, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 307.03); renumbered by #14482 (formerly Mec 307.03)",
